{
    "title": "Little Panda: Princess Party",
    "description": "A grand ball will be held in the fairytale kingdom soon. The princesses have received invitations, but they haven't come up with any dress-up idea. Can you design ball looks for them and make them the center of attention?\r\n\r\nPRINCESS MAKEOVER\r\nDressing up princesses is an exciting thing to do! From facial SPA, makeup, hairstyle to outfit matching, you can try any dress-up steps you want to make the princesses stunning!\r\n\r\nMASSIVE ITEMS\r\nWith plenty of makeup and dress-up items and tools, such as lipstick, eye shadow, dresses, glass slippers, necklaces, costumes and more, you can have fun dressing up the princesses!\r\n\r\nBALL DESIGN\r\nWhat's more interesting is that the venue of the ball will also be designed by you! You can choose from four themes: forest, candy, ocean and magic. There are lots of decorations for you to use. Just get creative and make the ball unique for the princesses!\r\n\r\nThe makeup and outfits of the princesses are so beautiful and the ball is designed so creatively. You're really an imaginative stylist!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Dress up four beautiful princesses the way you like;\r\n- Get creative and design the ball in four different themes;\r\n- 200+ items for you to use: lipstick, eye shadow, tiaras and more;\r\n- Simulate the real dress-up process: facial SPA, makeup, hair styling and more!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 400 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's educational apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "A grand ball will be held in the fairytale kingdom soon. The princesses have received invitations, but they haven&#39;t come up with any dress-up idea. Can you design ball looks for them and make them the center of attention?<br><br>PRINCESS MAKEOVER<br>Dressing up princesses is an exciting thing to do! From facial SPA, makeup, hairstyle to outfit matching, you can try any dress-up steps you want to make the princesses stunning!<br><br>MASSIVE ITEMS<br>With plenty of makeup and dress-up items and tools, such as lipstick, eye shadow, dresses, glass slippers, necklaces, costumes and more, you can have fun dressing up the princesses!<br><br>BALL DESIGN<br>What&#39;s more interesting is that the venue of the ball will also be designed by you! You can choose from four themes: forest, candy, ocean and magic. There are lots of decorations for you to use. Just get creative and make the ball unique for the princesses!<br><br>The makeup and outfits of the princesses are so beautiful and the ball is designed so creatively. You&#39;re really an imaginative stylist!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- Dress up four beautiful princesses the way you like;<br>- Get creative and design the ball in four different themes;<br>- 200+ items for you to use: lipstick, eye shadow, tiaras and more;<br>- Simulate the real dress-up process: facial SPA, makeup, hair styling and more!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 400 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s educational apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
